[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3816878247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115567#issuecomment-3816878247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567","id":3816878247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jgPCn","user":{"login":"Senko-heart","id":171306838,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjXvVg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171306838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart","html_url":"https://github.com/Senko-heart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T10:45:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T10:45:41Z","body":"Associated PR: #112215","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3816878247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832998660","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115567#issuecomment-3832998660","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567","id":3832998660,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kdusE","user":{"login":"Senko-heart","id":171306838,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjXvVg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171306838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart","html_url":"https://github.com/Senko-heart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T05:31:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T05:31:02Z","body":"More information in support of my theory.\n\nSince `val parcelFileDescriptor` is a local variable and isn't stored in class fields, it becomes eligible for garbage collection, which means finalize can run.\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/refs/heads/main/core/java/android/os/ParcelFileDescriptor.java#1092\n\nEither `mWrapped` or `mFd` are initialized and released (closed); depending on the constuctor used, it can be one or the other. `getFileDescriptor` either propagates call to `mWrapped`, or returns `mFd`. `mFd` is borrowed, therefore `getFileDescriptor` is likely intended to be giving out borrowed file descriptors. `mWrapped` is likely to return it's underlying `mFd`, which would likely get closed when `mWrapped` is released.\n\nEarlier commit history simplifies reasoning, as there's much less code in the class, and `mWrapped` isn't present.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832998660/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3833787321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115567#issuecomment-3833787321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567","id":3833787321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kgvO5","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T08:47:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T08:47:50Z","body":"I can reproduce the issue, looking into it now.\n\nHowever, I'm not sure whether keeping the file channel opened indefinitely is a good idea. Keeping it open can also cause file locking issues, or descriptor leaks. Open file descriptors consume system resources, one or two files are fine, but multiple or large files open permanently can still cause issues.\nAlso persisted URI permissions only guarantee the ability to reopen the file, not keep an open indefinitely.\n\nThe recommended pattern on Android is to open, operate, and close, then reopen when needed.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3833787321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3834305539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115567#issuecomment-3834305539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567","id":3834305539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kitwD","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T10:35:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T10:35:12Z","body":"@Senko-heart Please test this PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115751\n\nI tested it with a simple project:\n- Before that PR: Got the `Bad file descriptor` error in around 25 min.\n- After that PR: Testing for last 90 min, didn't got the error yet!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3834305539/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838632481","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115567#issuecomment-3838632481","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567","id":3838632481,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kzOIh","user":{"login":"Senko-heart","id":171306838,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjXvVg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171306838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart","html_url":"https://github.com/Senko-heart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Senko-heart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T02:34:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T02:34:02Z","body":"After a bit of stress testing, I can't reproduce the issue anymore. Thank you.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838632481/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"r